# Trivy ignore file — CVEs accepted as no Debian package fix is available.
# These all have upstream patches, but the patched packages are not yet in
# the Debian stable apt repository, so apt-get upgrade cannot resolve them.
# Revisit when python:3.13-slim ships a Debian stable refresh that includes fixes.

# perl: CPAN.pm skips TLS certificate verification over HTTPS
# Risk: low — CPAN.pm is not used by this application at runtime
CVE-2023-31484

# zlib: integer overflow in zipOpenNewFileInZip4_6
# Risk: low — zlib is used by Python internals; the vulnerable code path
# requires crafted ZIP inputs not reachable from the MCP API surface
CVE-2023-45853

# glibc: static setuid binary dlopen may search LD_LIBRARY_PATH incorrectly
# Risk: low — container runs as non-root (uid 1000); no setuid binaries in use
CVE-2025-4802

# linux-pam: directory traversal
# Risk: low — PAM is not used by this application
CVE-2025-6020

# sqlite: integer truncation
# Risk: low — sqlite3 is a Python stdlib dependency; the vulnerable code path
# is not reachable through the MCP API surface
CVE-2025-6965

# ncurses: segmentation fault via _nc_wrap_entry()
# Risk: low — ncurses is a system library; the vulnerable code path is not
# reachable from the MCP API surface
CVE-2023-50495

# pam: libpam vulnerable to read hashed password
# Risk: low — PAM is not used by this application
CVE-2024-10041

# pam: unprivileged user to block another user namespace
# Risk: low — PAM is not used by this application
CVE-2024-22365

# sqlite: Denial of Service in SQLite
# Risk: low — sqlite3 is a Python stdlib dependency; not reachable from the MCP API surface
CVE-2025-29088

# perl: working directory race condition across threads
# Risk: low — perl is not used by this application at runtime
CVE-2025-40909

# tar: path traversal
# Risk: low — tar is not invoked by this application at runtime
CVE-2025-45582

# sqlite: integer overflow
# Risk: low — sqlite3 is a Python stdlib dependency; not reachable from the MCP API surface
CVE-2025-7458

# glibc: double free
# Risk: low — container runs as non-root (uid 1000); not exploitable from the MCP API surface
CVE-2025-8058
